 "narrative": [
  "A minimum grade point average of 2.0 is required for admittance to and graduation from the BA or BS degree program.",
  "Students must receive a grade of C– or better in any course to be counted toward fulfillment of the major requirements.",
  "All courses must be taken for a letter grade, with the exception of COGS 195, 198, and 199, which are taken Pass/Not Pass.",
  "Majors must obtain departmental approval for electives taken outside of the department.",
  "Lower Division (eleven courses, forty-four units or ten courses, forty units); Upper Division (twelve courses, forty-eight units)."
